# Structure updates nested in structure updates

```catala
declaration enumeration Choice:
  -- First
  -- Second

declaration structure Inner:
  data choice content Choice
  data amount content money

declaration structure Outer:
  data inner content Inner
  data other content integer

declaration flip content Outer
  depends on o content Outer
  equals
    o but replace {
      -- inner: o.inner but replace {
        -- choice: match o.inner.choice with pattern
          -- First: Second
          -- Second: First } }

#[test]
declaration scope Nested:
  output flipped content Outer
  output pair content (Inner, integer)

scope Nested:
  definition flipped equals
    flip of Outer {
      -- inner: Inner { -- choice: First -- amount: $10 }
      -- other: 3
    }
  definition pair equals
    (flipped.inner but replace { -- amount: $1 }, flipped.other)
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope Nested
┌─[RESULT]─ Nested ─
│ flipped =
│   Outer {
│     -- inner: Inner {
│       -- choice: Second
│       -- amount: $10.00
│     }
│     -- other: 3
│   }
│ pair = (Inner {
│           -- choice: Second
│           -- amount: $1.00
│         }, 3)
└─
```
